  "answer": "### Short Answer\nThe annual income tax return of an individual is due on or before April 15 of the following year after the close of the taxable year.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nTaxpayers should prepare their financial records and ensure that their income tax returns are filed by the April 15 deadline to avoid penalties and interest on late payments. It is advisable for individuals to keep track of their income and expenses throughout the year to facilitate accurate reporting and compliance with tax obligations.",
